# What digitization runs: `name keep from` or `name every Nm from`. See machines/README.md.

follow          every 5m    machines/digitization
pools           keep        troves/pools
names           keep        machines/digitization
loudspeaker     keep        machines/digitization
model-relay     keep        machines/digitization
asks            keep        machines/digitization
seats           keep        machines/digitization
senders         every 1m    machines/digitization
# The tanks, hourly: KV keeps a reply until something deletes it, so there is no rush, and a pass that finds
# nothing still costs one list operation (1,000 a day on the free plan); hourly is 24.
drain           every 1h    machines/digitization
# Every key held here, up to FCPM's keychain (../keychain); the same value is kept once.
flush           every 15m   machines/digitization
# This machine's tell: it carries its own lines, reading what it hears and serving its copy (../../docs/lines.md).
tell            every 5m    machines/digitization
# The library shed, kept to origin.local's branches; the city's shapes into its library branch, once a day.
shed            every 5m    machines/digitization
city            at 04:17    machines/digitization
layers          at 04:37    machines/digitization
